{{!-- Skrivro NOTICES — plain-text handlebars template for cargo-about.
    Invoked by scripts/gen-notices.sh. Output is appended to the
    repo-root NOTICES file after the npm-side license dump.

    Structure: per-license section, with the full text of the license
    followed by the list of crates that use it. Grouping by license
    (not per-crate) avoids repeating MIT / Apache-2.0 text for every
    single dep (hundreds of MITs in our tree); a redistributor only
    needs to preserve each distinct license text once.

    Triple-brace is used instead of double-brace everywhere to suppress
    handlebars' default HTML escaping. We emit plain text, not HTML, so
    the escape entities would just be noise in the output.

    This is a long-form handlebars comment ({{!-- ... --}}) rather than
    the short form ({{! ... }}) because the short form's parser chokes
    on triple-brace sequences inside the comment body.
--}}================================================================
=== Rust crate licenses ===
================================================================

Overview (crate count per license):
{{#each overview}}
  - {{{name}}}: {{{count}}} crate(s)
{{/each}}

{{#each licenses}}
----------------------------------------------------------------
License: {{{name}}} ({{{id}}})
----------------------------------------------------------------

Used by:
{{#each used_by}}
  - {{{crate.name}}} {{{crate.version}}}{{#if crate.repository}} — {{{crate.repository}}}{{/if}}
{{/each}}

License text:

{{{text}}}

{{/each}}
